二、详细问题清单（汇总后）
🟡 中危 问题1 — 分页时汇总与明细同源，汇总口径可能随页码变化
文件：frontend/src/views/reports/EmployeeWorkHoursReportView.vue　位置：约第 214 行
问题描述：loadReport 每次翻页都带 page/pageSize 请求，并用同一响应刷新 summary 与 summaryByEmployee。若后端汇总按分页结果计算，翻页后「工时合计/涉及员工/按员工汇总」会随页码变化，与「当前筛选条件下」标签语义矛盾，用户误读为全量统计。触发条件：任意翻页或修改 pageSize。
// ❌ 当前代码
```
async function loadReport() {
  loading.value = true
  summaryLoading.value = true
  try {
    const [dateFrom, dateTo] = dateRange.value || []
    const resp = await fetchEmployeeWorkHoursReport({
      page: page.value,
      pageSize: pageSize.value,
      ...
    })
    items.value = resp.items || []
    total.value = resp.total || 0
    applySummary(resp)
  }
```
修改建议：拆分汇总与明细分页：汇总只在筛选条件变化时请求一次（dimension=summary，不带分页），翻页只刷新明细。验证：翻到第 2 页确认「工时合计」不变且等于全量筛选结果。
// ✅ 正确做法
```
async function loadSummary() {
  summaryLoading.value = true
  try {
    const [dateFrom, dateTo] = dateRange.value || []
    const resp = await fetchEmployeeWorkHoursReport({
      dateFrom, dateTo,
      department: filters.department || undefined,
      employeeNo: filters.employeeNo || undefined,
      dimension: 'summary',
    })
    applySummary(resp)
  } catch (err) {
    ElMessage.error(err.message || '加载汇总失败')
  } finally {
    summaryLoading.value = false
  }
}

async function loadReport() {
  loading.value = true
  try {
    const [dateFrom, dateTo] = dateRange.value || []
    const resp = await fetchEmployeeWorkHoursReport({
      page: page.value, pageSize: pageSize.value, dateFrom, dateTo,
      department: filters.department || undefined,
      employeeNo: filters.employeeNo || undefined,
      dimension: 'detail',
    })
    items.value = resp.items || []
    total.value = resp.total || 0
  } catch (err) {
    items.value = []
    total.value = 0
    ElMessage.error(err.message || '加载员工工时报表失败')
  } finally {
    loading.value = false
  }
}

function handleSearch() {
  page.value = 1
  loadSummary()
  loadReport()
}
```
---
🟡 中危 问题2 — 快速切换筛选/翻页存在响应竞态，旧结果覆盖新结果
文件：frontend/src/views/reports/EmployeeWorkHoursReportView.vue　位置：约第 214 行
问题描述：loadReport 无请求序号或取消机制。用户连续点击查询或快速翻页时，先发出的慢请求可能后返回，把 items/total/summary 覆盖成过期数据。触发条件：网络抖动或后端慢查询下连续操作。
// ❌ 当前代码
```
async function loadReport() {
  loading.value = true
  ...
  const resp = await fetchEmployeeWorkHoursReport({ ... })
  items.value = resp.items || []
```
修改建议：引入自增 requestId，响应回来时比对是否为最新请求；或使用 AbortController 取消上一次请求。验证：DevTools 限速 Slow 3G，快速切换部门两次，确认最终展示最后一次筛选结果。
// ✅ 正确做法
```
let requestSeq = 0

async function loadReport() {
  const seq = ++requestSeq
  loading.value = true
  try {
    const [dateFrom, dateTo] = dateRange.value || []
    const resp = await fetchEmployeeWorkHoursReport({ ... })
    if (seq !== requestSeq) return
    items.value = resp.items || []
    total.value = resp.total || 0
    applySummary(resp)
  } catch (err) {
    if (seq !== requestSeq) return
    items.value = []
    summaryByEmployee.value = []
    total.value = 0
    ElMessage.error(err.message || '加载员工工时报表失败')
  } finally {
    if (seq === requestSeq) {
      loading.value = false
      summaryLoading.value = false
    }
  }
}
```
